title: "eo-waterbody-temp: EO water-surface temperature over the Yolo Bypass"
abstract: >-
  Retrieval of water-surface temperature from thermal satellite observations
  (ECOSTRESS, Landsat) over the Yolo Bypass, with a dissolved-oxygen-saturation
  diagnostic derived via the Benson & Krause (1984) equations.
type: software
authors:
